{"title": "Spell Amplification", "pageid": 28533, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Spell_Amplification", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Spell Amplification</b> is a passive feature that grants extra spells.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain an additional <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 2 Spell Slot</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Savant_Amulet\" title=\"Spell Savant Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Amulet_Necklace_B_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Savant_Amulet\" title=\"Spell Savant Amulet\">Spell Savant Amulet</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Spell Amplification can grant an extra spell slot once <i>per character</i> per long rest, despite the Spell Slot Depleted condition on the item.</li>\n<li>A level 1 spell upcast to consume a level 2 spell slot does not \"deplete\" this passive, allowing it to be unequipped and re-equipped for a new free level 2 spell slot repeatedly.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715165820\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 881/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7860/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2465/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 922861/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.019      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   32.019      1 -total\n 33.99%   10.883      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 28.53%    9.136      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 25.94%    8.306      1 Templa